WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
In Hindu tradition, Brahma is the creator.

2
00:00:03.650 --> 00:00:06.490
Yet very few temples are dedicated to him.

3
00:00:06.540 --> 00:00:09.380
Families welcome the
goddess Lakshmi at Diwali,

4
00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:12.800
with lamps, lotus flowers and gold coins.

5
00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:18.810
Hindus speak of one God, so why does a
mandir hold so many gods and goddesses?

6
00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:21.050
In this mission, you'll meet the creator,

7
00:00:21.100 --> 00:00:26.440
the preserver and the destroyer, and
the goddesses Hindus see as their power.

8
00:00:26.490 --> 00:00:29.760
Then you'll weigh up a famous
claim about Hindu worship,

9
00:00:29.810 --> 00:00:32.380
with strong reasons on both sides.

10
00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:37.640
Your mission: find out why one mandir
can hold so many gods and goddesses.
